<title>UK: Lehman sets warrants on S&amp;P volatility.</title>
<headline>Lehman sets warrants on S&amp;P volatility.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance said it has issued 10 million European-style put warrants on S&amp;P 500 September 1997 Future Historic Volatilty.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one index.</p>
<p> INDEX VALUE   **$1.0			ISSUE PRICE  $7.5</p>
<p> EXERCISE DATE   19.SEP.97		 PAYDATE	06.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> NOTES	   **PER VOLATILITY POINT. MINIMUM REDEMPTION</p>
<p>		     VALUE $0.01.</p>
<p>		     REDEMPTION IS LINKED TO A COMPLEX FORMULA</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
